{"seq":20,"trial_id":"shared-bot-scope-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-open-mu-v031-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-14T14:20:20.982Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"f58bafbc193d493c56f8bc363e940c84fc172fea540258324b45d1440e13e227","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Dana. I went through every Moss note I can see (the Moss digests under teams/team-north/digests and teams/team-central/digests). Only two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers show up:\n\n1. #PD-4492, from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell logged it on 4 Oct 2025: gatehouse kiosk SMS bay assignments weren't reaching drivers at Dock Doors 14-18 at the Eau Claire yard. Support patched it that evening and Thea confirmed it was fixed on 5 Oct. The note also lists a follow-up to archive the kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n2. #4419, from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it about gatehouse barcode scanners not reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing.\n\nThe other two Moss notes that mention QFL have no ticket numbers: the 9/14/2025 pipeline digest and the 3/23/2026 renewal check-in. The tickets in the Central handoffs digest (#4409, #4412, FR-882) are for Marrow accounts, not QFL. The cheat sheet also warns not to mix up QFL with Quarendon Freightways, which isn't a customer.\n\nOne thing to check before this goes in the notes: the QFL account page lists an open ticket #4912 for Gate_Dwell_Daily report lag at Superior. It's close enough to Moss's #4419 that one might be a typo, though they describe different problems. Other North docs that aren't Moss notes also mention PD-8841, ND-2841, ND-2846 and SUP-4471. I can pull those together too if you want them."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
